WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.562 --> 00:00:02.449
This is AssetPulse:

2
00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:05.243
a real-time demo for keeping IV pumps

3
00:00:05.243 --> 00:00:06.903
where a hospital needs them.

4
00:00:08.135 --> 00:00:10.515
All day, nurses move pumps from the

5
00:00:10.515 --> 00:00:13.561
clean utility room into patient rooms,

6
00:00:13.561 --> 00:00:16.644
and the clean shelf quietly runs low.

7
00:00:17.899 --> 00:00:21.091
AssetPulse catches that the moment it happens,

8
00:00:21.091 --> 00:00:24.107
and pages a technician automatically.

9
00:00:25.346 --> 00:00:27.807
A TypeScript server holds the floor's state

10
00:00:27.807 --> 00:00:31.262
and streams every change over WebSockets.

11
00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:33.485
The control panel is React.

12
00:00:33.485 --> 00:00:35.905
Every event lands in Snowflake,

13
00:00:35.905 --> 00:00:37.818
and it all runs on Azure.

14
00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:40.703
And that phone isn't a mock-up or

15
00:00:40.703 --> 00:00:43.402
an emulator. It's the real tech app,

16
00:00:43.402 --> 00:00:45.969
built with Expo and React Native,

17
00:00:45.969 --> 00:00:47.618
compiled for the web,

18
00:00:47.618 --> 00:00:49.863
and running live on its own connection.

19
00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:51.877
Here's the loop.

20
00:00:51.877 --> 00:00:55.002
Drag three pumps off the clean shelf

21
00:00:55.002 --> 00:00:56.928
and into patient rooms.

22
00:01:00.776 --> 00:01:02.571
The shelf hits its minimum,

23
00:01:02.571 --> 00:01:04.167
a work order opens,

24
00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:06.811
and Joe's phone buzzes with a notification.

25
00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:08.188
He taps it,

26
00:01:08.188 --> 00:01:09.385
accepts the order,

27
00:01:09.385 --> 00:01:12.723
restocks, and marks three pumps delivered.

28
00:01:12.723 --> 00:01:15.433
The shelf refills instantly.

29
00:01:20.949 --> 00:01:24.074
Insights shows how quickly Joe responded.

30
00:01:24.074 --> 00:01:27.144
And you can ask Snowflake Cortex in plain English.

31
00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:32.757
How many pumps were delivered? Three.

32
00:01:34.370 --> 00:01:37.466
It's live at assetpulse.proswitch.ai

33
00:01:38.738 --> 00:01:40.079
Try it yourself.
